                               f"[{tag}] the synced close did not record the toggle ({c_es}): the walk is not reaching the switch, "
                               "so the cut trials measure nothing -- read the frames of tools/vm-walks/ui-settings-toggle.steps")
            f += not check(not tmp, f"[{tag}] no system.cfg.tmp left", f"[{tag}] system.cfg.tmp left behind (SystemConf copies its tmp instead of renaming it)")
            # Informational, not a check: Settings are loaded before the log
            # file is opened, so the parse error of a torn file never reaches
            # es_log.txt (0 on every torn boot, 2026-09-10) -- an assertion on
            # it could not fail.
